title HUNK78 — an AND of clauses: narrow the marketplace on several facets at once
prompt continue the recursion after HUNK77; take the next agent-doable HUNK lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve the design round, send as its own signed round to origin and xykj61, stop at custody gates
think HUNK75 filters by one Query, HUNK76 parses one clause, HUNK77 draws the result on glass — yet the search narrows on ONE facet at a time. A real parts marketplace is faceted (the stainless bolts under a dollar). The next durable crux is the conjunction: a line of clauses meaning the intersection of their matches.
think The ground was already laid — HUNK75's filter_catalog composes, so a multi-clause search is by construction the successive narrowing of each clause. Chose a fast single-pass conjunction (matches_all = part_filter.matches asked of every clause) and proved it equals the slow successive filter_catalog fold name-for-name, so no new matching rule is invented.
think The honest identity: an empty (all-blank) line is a match-all — a fold over zero clauses reproduces the catalog byte-for-byte. A keeper who has typed nothing sees the whole marketplace. Zero clauses is a valid AndQuery, count 0.
obs Durable property proven on metal over five parts: material:stainless-304 max:60 keeps only hexnut (intersection, equal to the fold), the clauses COMMUTE (price-then-material keeps the same one), three clauses narrow to the bolt, a single clause behaves like the plain filter, a match-none compound yields a real empty catalog, and a malformed clause (UnknownKey, NoColon) plus an over-many line (TooManyClauses) each refuse by name before any walk.
obs A price clause compares a recorded cent count, nothing moved — custody gate #3 untouched. No network, no key, no funds. TAME bans clean (image on the scan roster), width exit 0; HUNK75 filter and HUNK76 parser stay GREEN beneath.
obs AndQuery defaults clauses to undefined (Query has no default kind) with count 0; matches_all only reads clauses[0..count], so the undefined tail is never touched. GREEN on first build.
loom witness=hunk_part_and_witness parts=5 clauses_max=8 conjunction=equals-successive-fold
